{"id": "EUVD-2026-98007", "enisaUuid": "3d6508dc-63b0-3ad0-ae29-a05bff894e91", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.121.0 and 16.x before 16.34.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in which certain endpoints fail to enforce proper authorization checks on document status modification. Authenticated low-privileged users can call these endpoints to modify data beyond their permitted role, bypassing intended role-based access restrictions.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:00", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T14:10:00", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-wp9w-rxmg-6pfj", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-15.121.0-missing-authorization-allows-unauthorized-status-modification"], "aliases": ["GHSA-mpfp-cmm2-68pc", "CVE-2026-109613"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6a733fa0-5b34-3a8d-875d-761069568fa2", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.121.0"}, {"id": "ac8ecbae-44d9-380b-9f04-c4e3d4428a3d", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.34.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a1aacd68-5e5c-37fa-8e86-4a164d1b534b", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}